{"title": "Thunderskin Cloak", "pageid": 10411, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Thunderskin_Cloak", "categories": ["Cloaks", "Uncommon items", "Interact Reverberation set"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-uncommon\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Thunderskin_Cloak_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Thunderskin_Cloak_Faded.png/300px-Thunderskin_Cloak_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/9/94/Thunderskin_Cloak_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Thunderskin Cloak image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Thunderskin_Cloak_Faded.png/300px-Thunderskin_Cloak_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Thunderskin_Cloak_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Thunderskin Cloak</span></a> is an uncommon <a href=\"/wiki/Cloaks\" title=\"Cloaks\">Cloak</a> which has a chance to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dazed_(Condition)\" title=\"Dazed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Daze\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dazed_(Condition)\" title=\"Dazed (Condition)\">Daze</a> creatures that are <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Reverberation_(Condition)\" title=\"Reverberation (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Reverberating\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Reverberation_(Condition)\" title=\"Reverberation (Condition)\">Reverberating</a> when they damage the wearer.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Through a gap in the long snarls of thread, you are sure you can glimpse a great black thunderhead swollen with purple lightning and spears of rain.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cloaks\" title=\"Cloaks\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Cloaks_Icon.png/25px-Cloaks_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Cloaks_Icon.png/38px-Cloaks_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Cloaks_Icon.png/50px-Cloaks_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cloaks\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Cloaks_Icon.png/25px-Cloaks_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/aa/Cloaks_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cloaks\" title=\"Cloaks\">Cloaks</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Uncommon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Uncommon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 75 gp / 290 gpHHonour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  75  gp /  290  gp<abbr title=\"Honour mode only\" class=\"bg3wiki-damage-rider-source nomobile\">H</abbr><sup class=\"mobileonly\">Honour</sup></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_Thunder_InflictDazeOnReverberatedCreature_Cloak</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Thunder_InflictDazeOnReverberatedCreature_Cloak\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Thunder_InflictDazeOnReverberatedCreature_Cloak\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">c4c5150c-0931-4d9e-b7b2-36f40d56c290</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:c4c5150c-0931-4d9e-b7b2-36f40d56c290\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:c4c5150c-0931-4d9e-b7b2-36f40d56c290\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Dazing_Echo\" title=\"Dazing Echo\">Dazing Echo</a></dt><dd>When a creature with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Reverberation_(Condition)\" title=\"Reverberation (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Reverberation\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Reverberation_(Condition)\" title=\"Reverberation (Condition)\">Reverberation</a> deals damage to the wearer, the creature needs to make a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;13 Constitution Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dice_rolls#Save_DCs\" title=\"Dice rolls\">DC</a>&nbsp;13 <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> or become <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dazed_(Condition)\" title=\"Dazed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dazed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dazed_(Condition)\" title=\"Dazed (Condition)\">Dazed</a>.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Dazed\"> Condition: Dazed </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dazed_(Condition)\" title=\"Dazed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dazed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dazed_(Condition)\" title=\"Dazed (Condition)\">Dazed</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"CON Save (DC&nbsp;13)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">CON</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DC\">DC</a>&nbsp;13)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>, can't take <a href=\"/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reactions</a>, and loses the <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> bonus to their <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a>.</li>\n<li>Removed if an ally <a href=\"/wiki/Help\" title=\"Help\">Helps</a> this creature.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Moonrise Towers</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-128&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-193</span>: Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Araj_Oblodra\" title=\"Araj Oblodra\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png/25px-Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png/38px-Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png/50px-Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Araj Oblodra\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png/25px-Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Araj_Oblodra\" title=\"Araj Oblodra\">Araj Oblodra</a> on the main floor</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-92&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-78</span>: Sold by Araj Oblodra in <a href=\"/wiki/Crimson_Draughts\" title=\"Crimson Draughts\">Crimson Draughts</a> if not acquired from her in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Two\" title=\"Act Two\">Act Two</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\n<p><i>Regarding Dazing Echo:</i></p>\n<ul><li><b>Dazing Echo</b> may be activated by intentionally triggering an opponent's <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/30px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Opportunity Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w